            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Draftava 1.3.20

- Introduces license activation with a 14-day free trial.
- Adds license verification and deactivation.
- Stores activation securely in macOS Keychain.
- Supports up to 14 days of offline access after verification.
- Matches the License window to Draftava's selected theme.

No changes to draft persistence or iCloud conflict handling.
]]></description>
